 -200 if you are, more solo kills, and enemy ganks succeed 62%. even = ganks 38%. passive = ganks only 12% and the gold you lose in a weaker lane is almost halved.\nJungle: gank_X = gank enemy lane X (works against aggressive/even laners; if both junglers go to the same lane they skirmish there; a failed gank costs gold). farm = +300 gold, safe. invade = steal camps (+350 you / -250 them) unless they invade too (then a skirmish); their jungler may kill yours if it is much stronger. Missing → even lanes, farm."},{"n":6,"side":1,"situation":"LEAGUE OF LEGENDS — game time 00:00. You are \"Challenger\" (RED side) vs \"Bot Analyst\" (BLUE side). This decision: the laning plan for 00:00-08:00.\nSCORE: kills you 0 - enemy 0 | gold you 2.5k vs enemy 2.5k | GOLD DIFF +0 | towers destroyed: you 0, enemy 0 | inhibitors destroyed: you 0, enemy 0\nPOWER NOW: you +1% → EVEN (team-fight strength from gold, comps, power curves, drakes and buffs, before stances; ±5% = EVEN, ±12% = CLEARLY). In 8 min at the same gold: you -2% (EVEN).\nOBJECTIVES: Next drake: cloud (drake #1) at 05:00. Soul = first team to 4 drakes, soul type mountain. Dragons: you 0 [], enemy 0 [].\nVoid grubs: you 0, enemy 0. Herald: spawns 14:00 (you 0, enemy 0). Baron: spawns 20:00 (you 0, enemy 0).\nYOUR COMP: EARLY, best stance pick | stance fit: engage 1.33, siege 0.68, pick 1.63, split 0.99, protect 0.62 | frontline 6, peel 1, engage 8, poke 3, waveclear 5, pick 9, splitpush 5, dps 7 | damage AD 5/AP 0\nYour champions: top Rageborn (bruiser AD early, lane 3) 0/0/0 0.5k; jungle Wildroar (bruiser AD early, lane 3) 0/0/0 0.5k; mid Duskdancer (assassin AD early, lane 3) 0/0/0 0.5k; adc Longshot (marksman AD mid, lane 2) 0/0/0 0.5k; support Ironhorn (engage AD early, lane 3) 0/0/0 0.5k\nENEMY COMP: EARLY, best stance protect | stance fit: engage 1.07, siege 1.28, pick 0.89, split 1.02, protect 1.30 | frontline 6, peel 6, engage 5, poke 6, waveclear 10, pick 4, splitpush 3, dps 9 | damage AD 2/AP 3\nEnemy champions: